        ]
      },
      {
        "topic": "Discontinuity formation",
        "details": [
          "Shock waves are an example of discontinuities in interesting solutions. [Printed p. 4, Section 1.1.2.]",
          "Smooth initial data do not preclude later discontinuities for nonlinear conservation laws. [Printed pp. 4–5, Section 1.1.2, paragraph spanning the page break.]"
        ]
      }
    ]
