  "undebatable_constraints": [
    "Preserve both parts of the discontinuity claim: failure of the classical differential equation at a discontinuity and continued validity of the integral conservation law for the solutions under discussion. [Printed p. 5, Section 1.1.2, second paragraph.]",
    "Preserve the time derivative of the spatial integral and the left-endpoint minus right-endpoint flux order in (1.10). [Printed p. 4, (1.10).]",
    "Do not turn discontinuity alone into a sufficient condition for satisfying the integral law; the passage concerns conservation-law solutions. [Printed pp. 4–5, Sections 1.1.1–1.1.2.]",
